51921	52021	51749	51749	Rose	646	' A sort of protection - money that Low - Country gentlemen and heritors , lying near the Highlands , pay to some Highland chief , that he may neither do them harm himself , nor suffer it to be done to them by others ; and then if your cattle are stolen , you have only to send him word , and he will recover them ; or it may be , he will drive away cows from some distant place , where he has a quarrel , and give them to you to make up your loss . '
